  "method": "OpenStreetMap building way 283559227, name 'Building 203', alt_name 'Physics Building' (building=yes), used verbatim. Identification with the ATLAS building rests on the Argonne laboratory report ANL/PHY/PP-87036 (src:geo-argonne-atlas-lab-portrait).",
